weight wjʹ and objective weight wjʹʹ. Among the indicator types, the maximum wi was the eye movement indicator (0.436) and the minimum wi was the subjective indicator (0.193). Among the specific indicators, the maximum wi was the accuracy indicator (0.236) and the minimum wi was the horizontal spread of search indicator (0.086).
